BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pavements
DTSTART:20250604T230000Z
DTEND:20250605T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20250604T230000Z
UID:xPFOm83Zuf
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 128 mins (2h08m)\n\nAlex Ross Perry surveys the embl
 ematic 1990s US indie rock band in typically idiosyncratic style: part-doc
 umentary\, part-biopic\, part-stage musical—but all Pavement. May 30\, 7
 :00 pm Screening - Producer Gabe Spierer scheduled to attend for a post-fi
 lm Q&A. Also\, win a sweet Pavement record on vinyl from Hex Enduction via
  trivia\, and the first 20 customers in the door will receive $5 gift card
 s to Royal Records!\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/pavements
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
